{{#if hasMinUsers}}
<div class="region-config standard-form">
    <header class="">
    <p class="hint" style="text-shadow: 0 0 red; text-align: center">此功能仍处于实验开发阶段，<strong>可能存在错误</strong>。</p>
    <p class="hint" style="text-shadow: 0 0 red; text-align: center">对于需要技能检定的终端，旁观者<b>看不到技能检定请求</b>。这是已知问题，将在后续版本修复。</p>

        <div class="" style="padding: .25em; padding-bottom: 1em">
        共享终端视图
        <span style="opacity: .75; margin-bottom: .5em">— 终端始终由一个“来源用户”控制。使用旁观功能可将终端视图镜像给多个用户，就像旁观者从来源用户肩后观看一样。</span>
        </div>
        <button type="button" data-action="showLimits" style="margin-bottom: .2em"><i class="fa-solid fa-traffic-cone"></i> 限制</button>
        <div style="display: none; margin-top: .4em; margin-bottom: .4em" class="terminal-shadow-tips">
            <ul style="margin: 0">
                <li>旁观者看不到技能检定/物品要求窗口。</li>
                <li>不支持视角平移，这也适用于侦测移动和观察角色。</li>
                <li>如果来源用户已通过密码页面，旁观者仍需手动输入密码。</li>
                <li>旁观终端窗口目前必须手动关闭；后续版本会在来源用户关闭时自动关闭。</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

    </header>
    <style>
        .spinner {
            border-style: solid;
            border-color: #312c85;
            border-top-color: #0000;
            border-width: 2px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 15px;
            height: 15px;
            animation: spin .8s linear infinite;
        }
        .hover-grow {
          transition: transform 0.1s ease-in-out;
        }
        .hover-grow:hover {
          transform: scale(1.02);
        }
        @keyframes spin {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }
    </style>
    <div class="standard-form">
        <fieldset>
            <legend><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-pointer"></i> 手动</legend>

<div class="players-container terminal-shadow-select">
            <p class="hint">选择一个或多个用户作为旁观者。</p>

            <div  style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;">

                {{#each activePlayers}}
                <div class="player-box hover-grow" data-action="shadowSelect" pid="{{this.id}}" style="width: 100px; height: 100px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; position: relative; border: 2px dashed {{#if this.terminalSelected}}orange{{else}}dimgray{{/if}}; background: black; cursor: pointer; margin: .2em">
                    {{#if this.content}}
                        {{this.content}}
                        <div class="loading" style="width: 15px; height: 15px;">
                            <div class="spinner"></div>
                        </div>
                    {{else}}
                        <img src="{{this.avatar}}" style="opacity: .15; position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events:none"/>
                        <p style="font-size: .8em; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px; text-align:center; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: {{this.color}}; text-decoration-thickness: 3px; pointer-events:none; color: white">{{this.name}}</p>
                    {{/if}}
                </div>
                {{/each}}
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <button type="button" data-action="shadowSubmit" style="font-family: 'Bruno Ace'"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> 确认旁观者</button>
            </div>

</div>

<div class="players-container terminal-source-select" style="display: none;">
            <p class="hint">选择一个用户作为来源。</p>

            <div  style="flex-wrap: wrap; display: flex">

                {{#each activePlayers}}
                <div class="player-box hover-grow" data-action="sourceSelect" pid="{{this.id}}" style="width: 100px; height: 100px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; position: relative; border: 2px dashed dimgray; background: black; cursor: pointer; margin: .2em">
                    {{#if (eq ../uid this.id)}}
                      {{#if @root.inTerminal}}
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-computer" style="color: white"></i>
                      {{else}}
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-person-walking" style="color: white"></i>
                      {{/if}}
                    {{else}}
                    <div class="loading" style="width: 15px; height: 15px;" uid="{{this.id}}">
                        <div class="spinner"></div>
                    </div>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-computer terminal-shadow-{{this.id}}" style="display:none" uid="true.{{this.id}}"></i>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-person-walking terminal-shadow-{{this.id}}" style="display:none" uid="false.{{this.id}}"></i>
                    {{/if}}



                    <img src="{{this.avatar}}" style="opacity: .15; position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events:none"/>
                    <p style="font-size: .8em; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px; text-align:center; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: {{this.color}}; text-decoration-thickness: 3px; pointer-events:none; color: white">{{this.name}}</p>
                </div>
                {{/each}}
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <button type="button" style="font-family: 'Bruno Ace'" data-action="resetWindow"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left-from-line"></i> 返回</button>
            </div>

</div>



        </fieldset>

        <fieldset>
            <legend><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i> 自动</legend>


            <div class="form-group">
                <label style="flex:0">启用</label>
                <div class="form-fields">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="auto" {{#if auto}}checked{{/if}}>
                </div>
                <p class="hint">让一个用户自动旁观来源用户。</p>
            </div>
            {{#if auto}}
            <div class="form-group">
                <div class="form-fields">

                    <select name="shadow" style="flex: 2" data-tooltip="旁观者">
                      {{#each allPlayers}}

                        {{#if (eq this.id ../shadow)}}
                          <option value="{{this.id}}" selected>{{this.name}}</option>
                        {{else}}
                          <option value="{{this.id}}">{{this.name}}</option>
                        {{/if}}

                      {{/each}}
                    </select>

                    <i class="fa-solid fa-eye" style="flex:0"></i>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" style="flex:0"></i>

                    <select name="source" style="flex: 2" data-tooltip="来源">
                        {{#each allPlayers}}
                          {{#if (eq this.id ../source)}}
                            <option value="{{this.id}}" selected>{{this.name}}</option>
                          {{else}}
                            <option value="{{this.id}}">{{this.name}}</option>
                          {{/if}}
                        {{/each}}
                    </select>

                </div>

            </div>
                <button data-action="swap" style="margin-top: .5em;font-family: 'Bruno Ace'" data-tooltip="交换旁观者与来源用户" ><i class="fa-solid fa-right-left"></i> 交换</button>


            {{/if}}



        </fieldset>
    <div>
    <button data-action="refresh" style="display: none" />
</div>

{{else}}
<p class="hint">旁观功能至少需要 2 名用户。</p>
{{/if}}
